# What `clasp push` must never upload to the Apps Script project. Run clasp from
# this folder: .clasp.json's rootDir "" means this folder, not the repo root.
#
# skipSubdirectories is false, so every .js/.gs/.html/.json below this folder is
# a candidate. dev/ holds Node code (fs, vm, http); in the server's global scope
# it would throw and 500 every request.
#
# clasp replaces its built-in defaults once this file exists, so they are
# re-listed here rather than assumed.
**/node_modules/**
**/.git/**
dev/**
package.json
package-lock.json
# Markdown cannot be pushed at all -- .clasp.json declares only .js/.gs, .html
# and .json as push candidates -- so this glob is belt-and-braces.
*.md
